flowchart TD
  A[User request] --> B[SLI measurement]
  B --> C[SLO + error budget]
  C --> D[Multi-window burn alert]
  A --> E[End-to-end deadline]
  E --> F[Bounded retries + idempotency]
  F --> G{Circuit breaker}
  G -->|Closed| H[Dependency call]
  G -->|Open| I[Safe fallback router]
  H -->|Failure threshold| G
  I --> J[Fresh cache / retrieval-only / unavailable]
  J --> K[User response + audit]
  H --> K
  L[Queue and concurrency limits] --> F
  L --> I
